#
# Notices: this repository's own licence and notice, which the packaged app must
# carry. The prepared tree already has a LICENSE and a NOTICE.md at its top level,
# and those are upstream's, so ours travel under names of their own: both have to
# ship, because the app contains upstream's code as well as ours. The app's About
# page names all four, which is the only way a reader can tell whose is whose.
LICENSE WolkaraForever-LICENSE add
NOTICE.md WolkaraForever-NOTICE.md add
